Weekly retrospectives
At the end of each week review the mood and win history stored in
dopamine_guardian.db (or the path configured via DOPAMINE_DB_PATH).
Look for patterns—are there days where energy consistently dips? Do
certain events trigger a flurry of wins? Use these insights to adjust
meeting schedules, assign rest breaks or celebrate specific milestones at a
team level.

Customisation
The guardian is intentionally easy to extend. Consider the following
enhancements:

New triggers: Add parsing logic in _process_log_message for other
keywords or events (e.g. "bug fixed", "pull request merged").

More GIFs: Expand the list of GIF URLs in _celebrate to better fit
your team’s sense of humour.

Voice notes: Integrate a text‑to‑speech library or pre‑recorded
messages to send audio clips during celebrations.

Custom reward logic: Modify self.reward_amount per event type or
introduce diminishing returns for spamming /win.

With these practices and customisations you will transform the Dopamine
